{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-20", "prepared_on": "2026-11-20", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-20</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic goes public on Nasdaq in a record-breaking IPO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 登陸那斯達克，創下史上最大 IPO 紀錄</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic began trading as \"ANT\" at an $83 IPO price, opened at $111.50 and raised about $81.3 billion, the largest IPO ever. It is the first frontier AI company to list.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 以股票代號 ANT 掛牌，發行價 83 美元，開盤衝上 111.5 美元，募資約 813 億美元，是史上最大 IPO，也是全球首家上市的前沿 AI 公司。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180671\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Google launches Gemini 4 Neon, edging past Claude on coding benchmarks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 推出 Gemini 4 Neon，程式評測成績略勝 Claude</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Neon targets complex coding, enterprise data analysis and long-running agent tasks. In Antigravity it plans and reviews work while the faster Gemini 4 Hydrogen edits code and runs tests.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Neon 主打複雜程式開發、企業資料分析與長時間代理任務。在 Antigravity 中由 Neon 規畫並檢查成果，速度較快的 Hydrogen 負責改程式與跑測試。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180663\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Gemini on Mac can now use your computer<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Gemini 在 Mac 上開始支援電腦操作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's Gemini app for macOS can now handle multi-step tasks across local files, desktop apps and the web, such as filling in forms and making presentations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 的 Gemini macOS 版新增電腦操作，可跨本機檔案、桌面應用程式與網站完成多步驟工作，例如填表單、製作簡報。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1037902/google-gemini-macos-ai-computer-use\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> European Commission hit by AI-powered cyberattack using open-source ARTEX<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">歐盟執委會遭 AI 網攻，開源工具 ARTEX 成駭客利器</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Commission confirmed an attack detected on October 22 that used the open-source AI pentest framework ARTEX. Some internal systems are still down, and whether staff data leaked is unclear.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">歐盟執委會證實 10 月 22 日偵測到使用開源 AI 滲透測試框架 ARTEX 的攻擊，近一個月後部分內部系統仍無法使用，員工個資是否外洩尚待釐清。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180672\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Chinese hackers exploit VMware vCenter zero-day to plant backdoors<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">中國駭客利用 VMware vCenter 零時差漏洞入侵並部署後門</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Broadcom patched a critical vCenter authentication bypass, CVE-2026-123890, with no workaround other than updating. GTIG and Mandiant say the flaw surfaced while investigating the China-linked group Armory Castle.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">博通修補重大等級的 vCenter 身分驗證繞過漏洞 CVE-2026-123890，除了更新沒有其他緩解措施。GTIG 與 Mandiant 指出，此漏洞是調查中國駭客組織 Armory Castle 時發現的。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180674\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> The unfolding Jensen Huang scandal: a timeline<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳風波時間軸</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Jensen Huang has resigned from Nvidia following an affair, which could have national security ramifications as the U.S. and China race to build advanced AI infrastructure.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">黃仁勳因婚外情事件辭去 Nvidia 職務，在美中競逐先進 AI 基礎設施之際，可能衝擊國家安全。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huangs-affair-with-alleged-chinese-spy-a-timeline/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> California proposes stronger AI safety rules, including emergency model shutdown<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">加州擬強化 AI 安全監管，政府可緊急停用模型並限制研發算力</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Governor Gavin Newsom's proposals would let the state shut down high-risk AI models and curb AI systems that build stronger models. Large developers would face ongoing third-party safety verification, and legislation is still required.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">州長 Newsom 提出的建議包括賦予州政府緊急關閉高風險模型的權力、限制 AI 自行開發更強模型，並要求大型開發商接受持續性第三方安全驗證，仍須立法才能實施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180655\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Meta's AI agent Muse is mixing up conversations and could be exposing private data, report says<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">報導指 Meta 的 AI 代理 Muse 會混淆對話，可能外洩私人資料</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Employees reported Muse surfacing messages and bank balances they never created or owned. Ars Technica reports that Meta says the erratic outputs are not real data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">員工指出 Muse 會冒出他們從未發出的訊息，以及不屬於他們的銀行餘額。Ars Technica 報導，Meta 表示這些異常輸出並非真實資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/metas-ai-agent-muse-is-mixing-up-conversations-and-exposing-private-data-report-says/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Apple is hiring engineers to build its own AI agent<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Apple 招募工程師打造自家 AI 代理</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A job listing spotted by Bloomberg shows Apple building an agent that can browse the web, work across apps, write code and call services.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">彭博發現的職缺顯示，Apple 正在開發能瀏覽網頁、跨應用程式作業、寫程式並呼叫服務的 AI 代理。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1038227/apple-ai-agent-engineer-job-listing\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Research acceleration: The jagged frontier<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">研究加速：參差不齊的前沿</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI measures how coding agents are speeding up AI research, where their performance remains uneven, and what this signals about recursive self-improvement.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 衡量程式代理如何加速 AI 研究、哪些地方表現仍不穩定，以及這對遞迴式自我改進代表什麼。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/research-acceleration-jagged-frontier\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}